---
source: tui/src/keymap_setup.rs
expression: snapshot
---
Focus Main Composer | leader c (ctrl-x c) | Global focus_main_composer Focus Main Composer Focus the main conversation composer. leader c (ctrl-x c) Default
Focus Sidebar Tabs | leader t (ctrl-x t) | Global focus_sidebar_tabs Focus Sidebar Tabs Open the sidebar tab chooser. leader t (ctrl-x t) Default
Focus Sidebar Content | leader s (ctrl-x s) | Global focus_sidebar_content Focus Sidebar Content Focus the side conversation, or hide it when already focused. leader s (ctrl-x s) Default
Hide Pane | leader - (ctrl-x -) | Global hide_pane Hide Pane Hide the focused sidebar pane. leader - (ctrl-x -) Default
Close Sidebar Tab | leader w (ctrl-x w) | Global close_sidebar_tab Close Sidebar Tab Close the active sidebar tab. leader w (ctrl-x w) Default
Sidebar Up | leader shift-tab (ctrl-x shift-tab), leader up (ctrl-x up), leader k (ctrl-x k) | Global sidebar_up Sidebar Up Switch to the previous sidebar tab. leader shift-tab (ctrl-x shift-tab), leader up (ctrl-x up), leader k (ctrl-x k) Default
Sidebar Down | leader tab (ctrl-x tab), leader down (ctrl-x down), leader j (ctrl-x j) | Global sidebar_down Sidebar Down Switch to the next sidebar tab. leader tab (ctrl-x tab), leader down (ctrl-x down), leader j (ctrl-x j) Default
Focus Pane Left | leader left (ctrl-x left), leader h (ctrl-x h) | Global focus_pane_left Focus Pane Left Focus the parent conversation. leader left (ctrl-x left), leader h (ctrl-x h) Default
Focus Pane Right | leader right (ctrl-x right), leader l (ctrl-x l) | Global focus_pane_right Focus Pane Right Focus the open side conversation. leader right (ctrl-x right), leader l (ctrl-x l) Default
Minimize Pane Width | leader , (ctrl-x ,) | Global minimize_pane_width Minimize Pane Width Minimize the focused pane width. leader , (ctrl-x ,) Default
Maximize Pane Width | leader . (ctrl-x .) | Global maximize_pane_width Maximize Pane Width Maximize the focused pane width. leader . (ctrl-x .) Default
Equalize Pane Widths | leader = (ctrl-x =) | Global equalize_pane_widths Equalize Pane Widths Equalize visible pane widths. leader = (ctrl-x =) Default
Resize Panes | leader r (ctrl-x r) | Global resize_panes Resize Panes Enter keyboard resize mode for visible dividers. leader r (ctrl-x r) Default
Open Agents | unbound | Global open_agents Open Agents Open the agent command center. unbound Default
Open Transcript | ctrl-t | Global open_transcript Open Transcript Open the transcript overlay. ctrl-t Default
Find Transcript | f3 | Global find_transcript Find Transcript Find text in the full transcript. f3 Default
Focus Activity | f4 | Global focus_activity Focus Activity Focus transcript activity groups to expand or collapse their details. f4 Default
Open External Editor | ctrl-g | Global open_external_editor Open External Editor Open the current draft in an external editor. ctrl-g Default
Copy | ctrl-o | Global copy Copy Copy the last agent response to the clipboard. ctrl-o Default
Copy Code | alt-y | Global copy_code Copy Code Copy the last fenced code block to the clipboard. alt-y Default
Clear Terminal | ctrl-l | Global clear_terminal Clear Terminal Clear the terminal UI. ctrl-l Default
Toggle Vim Mode | unbound | Global toggle_vim_mode Toggle Vim Mode Turn Vim composer mode on or off. unbound Default
Toggle Raw Output | alt-r | Global toggle_raw_output Toggle Raw Output Toggle raw scrollback mode. alt-r Default
Toggle Side Conversation | ctrl-/ | Global toggle_side_conversation Toggle Side Conversation Switch between a side conversation and its parent. ctrl-/ Default
Leader | ctrl-x | Global leader Leader Set the prefix used by shared leader shortcuts. ctrl-x Default
